        <ArticleTitle>Efficacy and Side Effects of Metformin in Type 2 Diabetes.</ArticleTitle>
        <Abstract>
          <AbstractText Label="BACKGROUND">Metformin is the first-line pharmacotherapy for type 2 diabetes.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="METHODS">We conducted a retrospective cohort study of 500 patients.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="RESULTS">Metformin significantly reduced HbA1c with common gastrointestinal side effects including diarrhea and abdominal discomfort.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="CONCLUSIONS">Metformin remains effective with a well-characterized safety profile.</AbstractText>
        </Abstract>
